{
  "_doc": [
    "The libraries the build fetches (CMake FetchContent), as pinned source archives with their SHA-256.",
    "tools/fetch_deps.py downloads each one once into out/deps, checks its hash and unpacks it; build.ps1 / build.sh",
    "then point CMake at those folders (FETCHCONTENT_SOURCE_DIR_<NAME>), so the configure needs no network and no git.",
    "'declared' is the CMake file that declares the library and 'tag' the GIT_TAG it names there: when the two differ",
    "(a PS2Recomp update moved the tag) the archive is not used and CMake fetches the library itself, as before.",
    "'set': tools = the recompiler tools' build (out/tools), game = the game's build folders.",
    "Each archive was checked against a git checkout of the same tag: identical files (line endings aside).",
    "To add or move one: download the archive, put its SHA-256 and size here, and run tools/fetch_deps.py --verify."
  ],
